  swarming with Russian tourists on and  off season the back custom has plummeted  since the crisis in Ukraine  Alexandra Baron Chavez has seen turnover  at the restaurant she runs reduced by  more than half the remaining trickle of  Russian customers has left locals  lunching among themselves again you just  don't see Russian visitors anymore  I count on one hand our last Russian  customers the local Porsche dealership  had been enjoying good business with  cross-border car buyers to cater to  demand from Kaliningrad the manager even  recruited russian-speaking staff  since the Ukraine crisis erupted earlier  this year though the inflow of Russians  looking to buy luxury goods from the  West has flagged and that slump in  business has also been affecting the  dealerships biggest source of turnover  repair and maintenance services the head  of the dealership hopes that crucial  business from the east will return  sooner or later  both Polish and Russian customers they  expect the highest quality they can get  and this is actually what they are here  for and that's what's in common between  Polish and Russian customers so we are  trying to stay away from the politics  and just to focus on our job back to the  shoe sole manufacturer where the manager  is determined to pursue his expansion  plans in Kaliningrad he's waiting for a  resolution of the Ukraine crisis and an  improvement in the investment climate in  Russia  you
 

